{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t美國中期選舉各個州分陸續投票。中期選舉將改選眾議院全部435席，以及參議院100席中的35席。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n有美國民調預測，民主黨有望由共和黨手上奪取眾議院控制權，但參議院的整體選情則仍有變數。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：梁家奇\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T12:22:55.095486+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":98,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T11:54:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T00:18:49.652582+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T12:18:44.070482+00:00","content_hash":"805f1fb288da452b1642c885f01f4b99dfd2eb434531b59a548194038c30f898","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}